    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d471">

                <pb facs="0567" n="451" sameAs="frus:frus1915/pg451"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 711.38/35a.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to Chargé
                    Davis</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-09-24T19:00:00-05:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">September 24, 1915—7 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Report present status of treaty. Early favorable action by Congress much to be
                    desired.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Polk</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
